  "calculation": {
    "expression": "-pct_change(close,1) / (rolling_median((high-low)/close,10) + 0.001)",
    "description": "Cross-sectional reversal signal: the prior daily return is negated and scaled by the instrument's recent median high-low range, with a small stabilizer. This makes reversal comparable across heterogeneous asset classes while avoiding unstable division by unusually narrow ranges."
